00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:07.030
Next Episode

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:06.320
This is Shima.

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:08.260
Arisa and the others have evacuated to the Earth...

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:12.070
...while Kouta, the Big Four, and I have stayed behind to train.

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.920
It's sad without everyone here. All right, I'll do my best!

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.250
Shipon, do your best!

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:19.850
The Genesis Mission is proceeding well...

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:21.560
But the only one that's not doing well is me.

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:23.350
That's not true at all! Do your best!

00:23:23.490 --> 00:23:26.530
That's right! I have no choice but to do my best! All right!

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:28.860
Fight! On the next episode of Stellvia of the Universe...

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:30.490
"Darkness Falls Again." Whee!

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:32.520
Huh?! Who was that just now? Arisa?

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:35.050
Episode Twenty-Four:
 Darkness Falls Again

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:33.620
Look forward to it!

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:34.910
Huh? Huh? Huh?
